{"k":"instruction","text":"Open http://127.0.0.1:8095/ and sign in with username admin and password typed exactly as the text {{env:APP_PASSWORD}} (type that literal text into the password field; it gets filled in automatically - do not guess or spell out any password). After signing in, navigate to the repository bench/bench-repo and open its Issues list. Report: (a) the exact titles of all OPEN issues, especially any whose title starts with 'Seed:', and (b) whether an issue titled 'fwgt10-n1 Bench Issue' already exists, and if so its issue number as displayed (e.g. #123)."}
